# Update parameters of already-spawned agents in place, mid-episode: no respawn, so position,
# velocity and route continue. Each entry names an agent by id; a field left at 0.0 / empty keeps
# the agent's current value, `agent_type` re-resolves the whole parameter set from that type first
# (then the numeric fields override). Pose, waypoints, kind and policy are ignored here.
arena_humansim_msgs/AgentState[] agents
---
bool success
string message
int32[] updated_ids
